ONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">◈ 캠프내용</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 입사서류작성법 / 이미지 메이킹</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 벽 없는 조직만들기 / 팀워크 교육</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 프리젠테이션 기술 교육</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">◈ 혜&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 택</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 캠프 수료자에게 취업기회 제공</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">※ 첨부 : 졸업생 취업역량강화 캠프 일정 1부.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 문의사항은 054-478-7930 (담당직원 : 문선영) 로 연락 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한컴바탕&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
